Package: ocm
Version: 0.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nodejs (>= 20), easy-rsa, openssl, adduser
Recommends: openvpn
Maintainer: OCM Maintainers <ocm@example.com>
Description: OCM - OpenVPN Credential Manager
 Secure, minimal admin panel to issue and revoke OpenVPN client credentials.
 Bundles a NestJS API and a React web console. OpenVPN is expected to be
 already installed on the host (the installer verifies it). The system starts
 with no administrator - create the first one with the ocm-admin CLI.
